---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Write Between the Lines — GDC 2026 | Adam Dolin">

  <section class="section talk-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="label">GDC 2026 &bull; Game Narrative Summit</span>
      <h1>Write Between the Lines</h1>
      <p class="talk-subtitle">Writing Games for a Polarized, Distracted, Media-Illiterate World</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section talk-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="talk-content">
        <div class="talk-description">
          <p>
            Players today are more media-savvy than ever — and less media-literate than we'd like.
            They consume narratives at an unprecedented rate but often lack the tools to engage
            critically with the stories we tell. So how do we, as game developers,
            meet them where they are?
          </p>
          <p>
            In this talk from GDC 2026, Alexa and I explore how to write games
            that respect your audience's intelligence while acknowledging the gap between consumption
            and comprehension — and how interactive media is uniquely positioned to close it.
          </p>
          <p>
            I'll eventually link a recording of this talk once its on the GDC Vault, but for now, here are the slides and session page.
          </p>
          <p> 
            Enjoy!
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="talk-links">
          <a href="/files/GDC2026_WRITE BETWEEN THE LINES.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary">
            View the Slides (PDF)
          </a>
          <a href="https://schedule.gdconf.com/session/write-between-the-lines-writing-games-for-a-media-illiterate-world/914283" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-outline">
            GDC Session Page &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="talk-image">
        <img src="/images/currentwork/WriteBetweentheLines.jpg" alt="Write Between the Lines — GDC 2026 Talk" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="back-link">
        <a href="/">&larr; Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .talk-hero {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .talk-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .talk-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .talk-body .container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .talk-description p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .talk-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .talk-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .back-link a {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .back-link a:hover {
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .talk-body .container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .talk-image {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
